BTW, why would you want to use type III SS for 1df variables?  The t-tests
on the individual coefficients would have given you the same answer:

> summary(lm(y ~ x1 + x2))$coef[c("x1", "x2"), "t value"]^2
       x1    x2 
 517.0717 689.2

Note that these are identical to the F statistics for the type III tests.

Best,
Andy

