                plot a bubble plot with x and y axes and z represented by the size of bubble

                label the plot with a few Greek characters

        }

I can accomplish the end goal by creating a data.frame separately, and then calling the guiPlot commands with source( ).  But life would be much easier if I could do it all in one function.

Any help would be greatly appreciated.

