From Russell.Ivory at MerrickBank.com  Thu Dec  4 22:40:34 2003
From: Russell.Ivory at MerrickBank.com
Date: Thu, 04 Dec 2003 15:40:34 -0700
Subject: fix: Greek letters in plot legend
