Many thanks to David L Lorenz, Bert Gunter, Stephen Smith, Alan Zaslavsky, and Spencer Graves for very quick and very helpful responses.  I found the best fix in my case was to use the assign( ) function with the where=1 argument to write a data.frame that guiPlot can read.  It works very well!

