Subject: Answer for: executing a formula created as a text string
In-Reply-To: <3FD3B0B5.5040900@pdf.com>
References: <Pine.OSF.4.58.0312071642480.28421@is02.fas.harvard.edu> <3FD3B0B5.5040900@pdf.com>
