Thanks to all who pointed to:

If a formula (e.g. "y ~ a1 + a2*x + a3*x/(a4 + x)" ) is in the text string
called ee

nls(as.formula(ee),dataframe=mydataframe)

will do the job, using the formula stated in the string, as desired.

