Hi. Here's what I would do. This usually works.

1.) Stop S-Plus.
2.) Go to your S-Plus home directory. There is a .Data and a .Prefs
directory. Delete the .Prefs directory. Do not delete .Data!
3.) Re-start S-Plus. It will ask you if it can create a new .Prefs. Say
